From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:15:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs: findings of the review of 36g2 and the hints of the
 reviews of 36A2

The heads of addendum 36g (AUDIT, HANDOFF, list after M1) and addendum
36 A to D93 name window 2 on the fallback as open, give 36A2 as
accepted by both reviewers, and take the figures of 36A2 from
20-notes "36A" and "36A2 Bericht" (ORCHESTRATION section 14); R17 (b)
and D93 name that source at the races of 36A2. Item 108 names window 2
on the fallback in both places; HANDOFF item 7 too, with its sources
and the style fixed.

D93 addendum 36 A: TestFilesInTempChangedAtUnlink works on aside
(after the link, and on the error path of a failed rename to the
name), TestDropTempAppendOnly is skipped wherever chattr +a is not
possible, and the reasons against a subdirectory of mode 0700 come
from the report of 36A2, the comment at dropTemp names only some of
them; the same skip in AUDIT 6.2. Item 127 takes H1 and H4 of the
specification review and H1 of the robustness review of 36A2.

